00000000                             5  * Description:  Demonstrate AND OR EOR operations
00000000                             6  *               In AND, resulting bit is 1 only if both source and destination bits are 1. So 1 and 1 gives 1, 1 and 0 gives 0
00000000                             7  *               In OR, resulting bit is 1 if either source or destination bit is 1. So 1 and 0 gives 1, 1 and 1 gives 1, 0 and 0 gives 0
00000000                             8  *               In EOR, resulting bit is 1 only if source or destination have different bit, so 0 and 1 will give 1, 1 and 1 will give 0. 0 and 0 will give 0
00000000                             9  *-----------------------------------------------------------
